<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-768] Failed to start LOCAL cache on part of the grid</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-768</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Steps to reproduce.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start first node.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start LOCAL cache &quot;A&quot; on first node (with node filter by node ID).&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start second node.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Start LOCAL cache &quot;A&quot; on second node (with node filter by node ID).&lt;br/&gt;
Got exception:
&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-java&quot;&gt;Exception in thread &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote&quot;&gt;&quot;main&quot;&lt;/span&gt; org.apache.ignite.cache.CacheExistsException: Failed to start cache (a cache with the same name is already started): local-nid
	at org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.cache.GridCacheProcessor.dynamicStartCache(GridCacheProcessor.java:1858)
	at org.apache.ignite.internal.processors.cache.GridCacheProcessor.dynamicStartCache(GridCacheProcessor.java:1827)
	at org.apache.ignite.internal.IgniteKernal.createCache(IgniteKernal.java:2258)
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;

</description>
