                            <comment id="14505048" author="yzhdanov" created="Tue, 21 Apr 2015 14:45:00 +0000"  >&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;this does not seem to be critical&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;workaround - give different names to local caches&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;proper behavior - Ignite should start local caches with the same name on different nodes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;Alex, can you please add test to sprint in the mean time and post class name here?&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="14506717" author="kuaw26" created="Wed, 22 Apr 2015 09:33:20 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;I added GridCacheLocalIsolatedNodesSelfTest into ignite-768 branch.&lt;br/&gt;
